# PUBLIC_URL was set to https://almanzatech.com, which baked that absolute
# origin into every asset URL in the build. That breaks previewing the build
# locally and breaks any staging/subdomain deploy, since the page would go on
# fetching its JS and video from the live site.
#
# The single source of truth is now "homepage": "/" in package.json, which
# produces root-relative paths (/static/js/...). Those work at the domain root,
# on a staging URL, and locally via `npx serve -s build`.
#
# Absolute URLs that genuinely need the real origin — og:image, twitter:image,
# canonical, and the JSON-LD block — are hardcoded in public/index.html, so
# they are unaffected.
#
# PUBLIC_URL=https://almanzatech.com
